    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About the free tier",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The app's **free tier** sends requests from the browser straight to OpenRouter with the user's own key (docs/design/ai-tiers.md): no Splanc server sees them, so they are not measured here. This board covers the **shared demo relay** only, which serves the same free models to the website playground and Acid Mode / kiosk."
      }
